            "review_text": "yvonne Malaya\nSingapore, Singapore11 contributions\n0\nVery conveniently located, just a short walking distance from Thao Dien metro! 👍\nJul 2025 • Solo\nI had such a great time at georges Saigon! The food was amazing, every dish we tried was delicious and full of flavor.\n\nWe were there on a Friday. Live band performance was from Fire Byte. The music was fantastic and really added to the atmosphere. It was so lively and fun.\n\nThe staff were just wonderful too. Real friendly, attentive, and always smiling.\n\nOverall, it’s such a cool spot to hang out, eat, and enjoy the vibe. Short walk from metro too. Definitely recommend it, and I’ll be coming back for sure! 👌\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2025",
