            "review_text": "Relax23359037661\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing night at Georges Saigon!\nAug 2025 • Friends\nThis 3-floor restobar is definitely a go-to party spot! 2nd level has billiards for some pre-drinks fun, the ground floor pumps up the night with live bands and a vibrant crowd, and the third floor tops it all off with a classy cocktail bar that’s cozy yet elegant. Whether you’re out to party, chill, or both this place has it all! Highly recommended for party animals 🍻\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 22, 2025",
